<title>UK: Rabobank sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Creditanstalt Bankverein.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.5	MATURITY    27.JAN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.89    PAY DATE    27.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    99.84     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 S&amp;P	  AAA	 LISTING  F  LUX</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 25-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
